+## A32 inline jump tables (add rB, pc; ldr pc, [rB, rI, lsl #2]; .word ...) are
+## re-emitted with absolute words and a rebased adr; a clobbered base is rejected.
+
+RUN: rm -rf %t.dir
+RUN: %python %p/Inputs/check-arm-ldr-pc-table.py %t.dir
